      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LENNY LIMES (8) goes very well at the course with four wins and a placing from eight starts. Scored by 2.25 lengths last time (17.69) in a Grade 5 over 305m at this track. Looks suited and should go close. COMPTON COPY (2) pinged the lids last start from an awkward draw and led throughout to score (23.06) at this track in a Other over 400m. Winner at her latest appearance in the quickest time on the card. Leading chance again. COMPTON TO AVOID (4) boasts a strong record this course with six wins and three minors from 14 tries. Placed last time (23.17) at this track in a Grade 2/3/4, finishing third and beaten 4.5 lengths. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. MAJOR QUEEN (5) generally performs well over this distance.",
